{
  "v": 5,
  "id": "3a3bd9aa-24cc-4833-a928-d1bcaa641f4e",
  "title": "3. 과업의 수행 방법론 — 전략동인 도출 (SVG)",
  "canvas": {
    "w": 1280,
    "h": 905
  },
  "source": {
    "kind": "kg-html",
    "html": "<section class=\"kg-slide kg-root\" data-screen-label=\"전략동인 도출형(SVG)\">\n  <header class=\"kg-header\">\n    <div class=\"kg-header__media\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__num kg-section-num\">03</div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__divider\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__titles\">\n      <div class=\"kg-section-title\">과업의 수행 방법론</div>\n      <div class=\"kg-section-sub\">전략동인 도출 · 계층별 지표 연계</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"kg-chapter-tab\">\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__roman\">III</span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__sep\"></span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tag\">추진방안 및 관리계획</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"kg-msgband\"><span class=\"kg-msgband__mark\"></span>\n    <p class=\"kg-message\">전략동인 나무(SDT)의 방향성에 따라 군집화(Clustering)로 예비 전략동인을 도출하여 전략지도의 인과관계로 검증하고, 계층 전개(Cascading)로 전사부터 팀까지 성과지표를 이어 비전 달성 구조를 확립</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"kg-body-area\">\n    <div class=\"kg-content s-halves\">\n\n      <!-- ================= 좌 ================= -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"kg-subtopic\">전략동인 나무 기반 전략목표·전략과제 연계</div>\n        <div class=\"col__b\">\n\n          <div class=\"steps\">\n            <!-- 1 · 트리 (library: sdt-tree) -->\n            <div class=\"kg-quad\">\n              <div class=\"kg-quad__hd\">\n                <span class=\"kg-quad__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">1</span>\n                <span class=\"kg-quad__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">전략동인 나무 작성</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"qbd\">\n                <div class=\"qsvg\">\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 280 124\" data-kg-lib=\"sdt-tree\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M60 62 H75 V26 H90\"></path><path d=\"M60 62 H75 V98 H90\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M158 26 H173 V13 H188\"></path><path d=\"M158 26 H173 V45 H188\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M158 98 H173 V83 H188\"></path><path d=\"M158 98 H173 V111 H188\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <rect x=\"2\" y=\"42\" width=\"58\" height=\"40\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"root\" x=\"31\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">전략방향</text>\n                    <rect x=\"90\" y=\"10\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l1a\" x=\"124\" y=\"30.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">수익 다변화</text>\n                    <rect x=\"90\" y=\"82\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l1b\" x=\"124\" y=\"102.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">미래산업 전환</text>\n                    <rect x=\"188\" y=\"0\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l2a1\" x=\"233\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">비면세 수익 확대</text>\n                    <rect x=\"188\" y=\"32\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l2a2\" x=\"233\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">보유자산 활용</text>\n                    <rect x=\"188\" y=\"70\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l2b1\" x=\"233\" y=\"87\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">첨단산업단지</text>\n                    <rect x=\"188\" y=\"98\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l2b2\" x=\"233\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">검증생태계 운영</text>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"qnote\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">비전·전략방향에서 출발해 성과에 영향을 주는 동인을 계층으로 전개</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 2 · 가지치기 -->\n            <div class=\"kg-quad\">\n              <div class=\"kg-quad__hd\">\n                <span class=\"kg-quad__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">2</span>\n                <span class=\"kg-quad__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">가지치기로 나무 축약</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"qbd\">\n                <div class=\"qsvg\">\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 280 124\" data-kg-lib=\"sdt-tree\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M60 62 H75 V26 H90\"></path><path d=\"M60 62 H75 V98 H90\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M158 26 H173 V13 H188\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M158 98 H173 V83 H188\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\">\n                      <path d=\"M158 26 H173 V45 H188\"></path><path d=\"M158 98 H173 V111 H188\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <rect x=\"2\" y=\"42\" width=\"58\" height=\"40\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"root\" x=\"31\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">전략방향</text>\n                    <rect x=\"90\" y=\"10\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l1a\" x=\"124\" y=\"30.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">수익 다변화</text>\n                    <rect x=\"90\" y=\"82\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l1b\" x=\"124\" y=\"102.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">미래산업 전환</text>\n                    <rect x=\"188\" y=\"0\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l2a1\" x=\"233\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">비면세 수익 확대</text>\n                    <rect x=\"188\" y=\"32\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--neutral-100)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l2a2\" x=\"233\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">종속 동인 제외</text>\n                    <rect x=\"188\" y=\"70\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l2b1\" x=\"233\" y=\"87\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">첨단산업단지</text>\n                    <rect x=\"188\" y=\"98\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--neutral-100)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"></rect>\n                    <text data-slot=\"l2b2\" x=\"233\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">중복 동인 제외</text>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"qnote\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">중복·종속 동인을 걷어내고 독립성이 확보된 동인만 남김</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 3 · 군집 권역 -->\n            <div class=\"kg-quad\">\n              <div class=\"kg-quad__hd\">\n                <span class=\"kg-quad__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">3</span>\n                <span class=\"kg-quad__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">군집화로 예비 동인·지표 도출</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"qbd\">\n                <div class=\"qsvg\">\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 280 124\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                    <g fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\">\n                      <rect x=\"1\" y=\"2\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"9\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"1\" y=\"44\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"9\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"1\" y=\"86\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"9\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\">\n                      <rect x=\"7\" y=\"8\" width=\"72\" height=\"24\" rx=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"85\" y=\"8\" width=\"72\" height=\"24\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"7\" y=\"50\" width=\"72\" height=\"24\" rx=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"85\" y=\"50\" width=\"72\" height=\"24\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"7\" y=\"92\" width=\"72\" height=\"24\" rx=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"85\" y=\"92\" width=\"72\" height=\"24\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                    <g font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text data-slot=\"a1\" x=\"43\" y=\"24\">비면세 수익</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"a2\" x=\"121\" y=\"24\">자산 활용</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"b1\" x=\"43\" y=\"66\">첨단산업단지</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"b2\" x=\"121\" y=\"66\">검증생태계</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"c1\" x=\"43\" y=\"108\">개발이익 환원</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"c2\" x=\"121\" y=\"108\">청정에너지</text>\n                    </g>\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--blue-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M162 20 H174\"></path><path d=\"M162 62 H174\"></path><path d=\"M162 104 H174\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--blue-500)\">\n                      <path d=\"M173 16 l8 4 -8 4 z\"></path><path d=\"M173 58 l8 4 -8 4 z\"></path><path d=\"M173 100 l8 4 -8 4 z\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">\n                      <rect x=\"184\" y=\"6\" width=\"94\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"184\" y=\"48\" width=\"94\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"184\" y=\"90\" width=\"94\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                    <g font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text data-slot=\"outA\" x=\"231\" y=\"24\">예비 동인 A</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"outB\" x=\"231\" y=\"66\">예비 동인 B</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"outC\" x=\"231\" y=\"108\">예비 동인 C</text>\n                    </g>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"qnote\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">군집별 대표 동인을 예비 전략동인으로 확정하고 성과지표 후보 도출</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 4 · 전략지도 인과 검토 -->\n            <div class=\"kg-quad\">\n              <div class=\"kg-quad__hd\">\n                <span class=\"kg-quad__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">4</span>\n                <span class=\"kg-quad__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">전략지도 인과관계 검토</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"qbd\">\n                <div class=\"qsvg\">\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 280 124\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M30 31 H280\"></path><path d=\"M30 62 H280\"></path><path d=\"M30 93 H280\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text x=\"2\" y=\"19\">재무</text><text x=\"2\" y=\"50\">고객</text>\n                      <text x=\"2\" y=\"81\">과정</text><text x=\"2\" y=\"112\">성장</text>\n                    </g>\n\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--blue-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M73 99 V85\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M110 74 L149 57\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M153 37 V25\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M190 99 L228 78\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M233 68 V25\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--blue-500)\">\n                      <path d=\"M69 88 L73 81 L77 88 z\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M145 62 L152 55 L149 63 z\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M149 28 L153 21 L157 28 z\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M224 83 L231 76 L228 84 z\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M229 28 L233 21 L237 28 z\"></path>\n                    </g>\n\n                    <g fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\">\n                      <rect x=\"36\" y=\"6\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"116\" y=\"68\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"196\" y=\"99\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">\n                      <rect x=\"36\" y=\"99\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"36\" y=\"68\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"116\" y=\"37\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"196\" y=\"6\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                    <g font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                      <text data-slot=\"m1\" x=\"73\" y=\"18\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\">전략과제</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"m2\" x=\"153\" y=\"80\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\">전략과제</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"m3\" x=\"233\" y=\"111\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\">전략과제</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"mA\" x=\"73\" y=\"111\" fill=\"var(--paper)\">예비 동인 A</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"mB\" x=\"73\" y=\"80\" fill=\"var(--paper)\">예비 동인 B</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"mC\" x=\"153\" y=\"49\" fill=\"var(--paper)\">예비 동인 C</text>\n                      <text data-slot=\"mR\" x=\"233\" y=\"18\" fill=\"var(--paper)\">전략목표</text>\n                    </g>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"qnote\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">관점별 인과 경로를 따라 예비 동인이 상위 성과로 이어지는지 대조</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"crit\">\n            <div class=\"kg-ghd\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">전략동인 군집화 기준</div>\n            <div class=\"crit__b\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"crit__k\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">독립적 시사</div>\n                <div class=\"crit__v\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">둘 이상의 하위 동인이 특정 상위 동인에 독립적이면서 전략적 중요도가 높은 경우 각각을 동인으로 설정</div>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"crit__k\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">선행 동인</div>\n                <div class=\"crit__v\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">상위 동인이 하위 동인의 단일 결과이거나 하위 동인의 중요도가 높은 경우 그 하위 동인을 중심으로 설정</div>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"crit__k\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">자원 초점</div>\n                <div class=\"crit__v\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">일련의 동인 사이에 경영자원의 성격 구분이 가능할 때 이를 나누어 동인으로 설정</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ================= 우 ================= -->\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"kg-subtopic\">전사–본부–단–팀 목표 및 지표의 계층 연계</div>\n        <div class=\"col__b\">\n          <div class=\"csd\">\n\n            <div class=\"tier tier--corp\">\n              <div class=\"tierh\">\n                <span class=\"tiern\" data-kg-role=\"num\">전사</span>\n                <span class=\"tiert\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">비전과 전략방향</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"tierb tierb--corp\">\n                <div class=\"vis\">\n                  <span class=\"visk\" data-kg-role=\"label\">미션</span>\n                  <span class=\"visv\" data-kg-role=\"body2\">자연을 닮은 미래를 담은 세계로 닿는 제주국제자유도시 조성</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"vis\">\n                  <span class=\"visk\" data-kg-role=\"label\">비전</span>\n                  <span class=\"visv\" data-kg-role=\"body2\">지속가능한 제주의 내일을 만드는 GLOBAL PARTNER</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"goals\">\n                  <div class=\"goal\" data-kg-role=\"label\">신성장산업</div>\n                  <div class=\"goal\" data-kg-role=\"label\">글로벌인프라</div>\n                  <div class=\"goal\" data-kg-role=\"label\">안전·신뢰경영</div>\n                  <div class=\"goal\" data-kg-role=\"label\">인공지능 혁신역량</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"link\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 28\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M18 1 C18 17 84 6 194 22\" stroke=\"var(--blue-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M186 16 L200 24 L185 27 z\" fill=\"var(--blue-500)\"></path>\n                <ellipse cx=\"108\" cy=\"13\" rx=\"38\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--navy-800)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></ellipse>\n                <text data-slot=\"c1\" x=\"108\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">계층 전개</text>\n              </svg>\n              <span class=\"link__t\">\n                <span class=\"link__q\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">전사의 비전과 중장기 목표를 달성하기 위해 본부는 무엇을 하는가</span>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"tier tier--unit i1\">\n              <div class=\"tierh tierh--mid\">\n                <span class=\"tiern\" data-kg-role=\"num\">본부</span>\n                <span class=\"tiert\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">본부 목표와 성과지표</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"tierb\">\n                <div class=\"org\">\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 64\" data-kg-lib=\"org-tree\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M70 13 V20\"></path><path d=\"M25 20 H115\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M25 20 V27\"></path><path d=\"M70 20 V27\"></path><path d=\"M115 20 V27\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M25 40 V48\"></path><path d=\"M70 40 V48\"></path><path d=\"M115 40 V48\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                      <rect x=\"53\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"10\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"55\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"100\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">\n                      <rect x=\"10\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"55\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"100\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi\">\n                  <div class=\"kpii\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">전략방향별 <b>소관 과제 배분</b></div>\n                  <div class=\"kpii\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">전사 지표의 <b>기여분 분해</b></div>\n                  <div class=\"kpii\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">선행지표·위험지표 병행 설정</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"link\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 28\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M34 1 C34 17 100 6 210 22\" stroke=\"var(--blue-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M202 16 L216 24 L201 27 z\" fill=\"var(--blue-500)\"></path>\n                <ellipse cx=\"124\" cy=\"13\" rx=\"38\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--navy-800)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></ellipse>\n                <text data-slot=\"c2\" x=\"124\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">계층 전개</text>\n              </svg>\n              <span class=\"link__t\">\n                <span class=\"link__q\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">본부의 주요 목표 달성을 위해 단은 무엇을 하는가</span>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"tier tier--unit i2\">\n              <div class=\"tierh tierh--mid\">\n                <span class=\"tiern\" data-kg-role=\"num\">단</span>\n                <span class=\"tiert\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">단위조직 목표와 성과지표</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"tierb\">\n                <div class=\"org\">\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 64\" data-kg-lib=\"org-tree\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M70 13 V20\"></path><path d=\"M25 20 H115\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M25 20 V27\"></path><path d=\"M70 20 V27\"></path><path d=\"M115 20 V27\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M25 40 V48\"></path><path d=\"M70 40 V48\"></path><path d=\"M115 40 V48\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                      <rect x=\"53\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"10\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"100\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"10\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"100\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">\n                      <rect x=\"55\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"55\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi\">\n                  <div class=\"kpii\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">본부 과제의 <b>실행단위 분할</b></div>\n                  <div class=\"kpii\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">본부 지표와 <b>산식 일치</b></div>\n                  <div class=\"kpii\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">분기별 목표수준·가중치 확정</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"link\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 28\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M50 1 C50 17 116 6 226 22\" stroke=\"var(--blue-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M218 16 L232 24 L217 27 z\" fill=\"var(--blue-500)\"></path>\n                <ellipse cx=\"140\" cy=\"13\" rx=\"38\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--navy-800)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></ellipse>\n                <text data-slot=\"c3\" x=\"140\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">계층 전개</text>\n              </svg>\n              <span class=\"link__t\">\n                <span class=\"link__q\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">단의 주요 목표 달성을 위해 팀과 개인은 무엇을 하는가</span>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"tier tier--unit i3\">\n              <div class=\"tierh tierh--lo\">\n                <span class=\"tiern\" data-kg-role=\"num\">팀·개인</span>\n                <span class=\"tiert\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">실행계획과 개인 성과계약</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"tierb\">\n                <div class=\"org\">\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 64\" data-kg-lib=\"org-tree\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                    <g stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\">\n                      <path d=\"M70 13 V20\"></path><path d=\"M25 20 H115\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M25 20 V27\"></path><path d=\"M70 20 V27\"></path><path d=\"M115 20 V27\"></path>\n                      <path d=\"M25 40 V48\"></path><path d=\"M70 40 V48\"></path><path d=\"M115 40 V48\"></path>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                      <rect x=\"53\" y=\"0\" width=\"34\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"10\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"55\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"100\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                    <g fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">\n                      <rect x=\"10\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"55\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                      <rect x=\"100\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                    </g>\n                  </svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi\">\n                  <div class=\"kpii\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">월 단위 <b>실행항목 배정</b></div>\n                  <div class=\"kpii\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">직무 기반 <b>개인 목표 설정</b></div>\n                  <div class=\"kpii\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">평가·보상 제도와 연결</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"kg-footer\">\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__src\">JDC 중장기 경영전략체계 진단 및 수립 — 전략동인 도출 및 계층별 지표 연계 방법론</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__page\">40</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__logo\"><img src=\"/kg/assets/keynes-group-logo.png\" alt=\"Keynes Group\"></span>\n  </footer>\n</section>",
    "css": ".kg-content{margin-top:12px;}\n  .col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;}\n  .col__b{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;gap:9px;}\n\n  /* ---- 좌: 4단계 사분면 ---- */\n  .steps{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;\n    gap:9px;min-height:0;}\n  .steps .kg-quad{min-height:0;}\n  .kg-quad__t{font-size:14px;}\n  .qbd{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;\n    gap:6px;padding:8px 9px;min-height:0;}\n  .qnote{font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--ink-700);border-top:1px dashed var(--neutral-300);\n    padding-top:5px;}\n  .qsvg{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;}\n  .qsvg svg{width:100%;height:100%;}\n\n  /* ---- 군집화 기준 ---- */\n  .crit{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}\n  .crit__b{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;padding:9px;\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 4px 4px;background:#fff;}\n  .crit__k{font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-800);margin-bottom:4px;\n    padding-bottom:3px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--blue-300);}\n  .crit__v{font-size:14px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--ink-700);}\n\n  /* ---- 우: 계단형 계층 전개 ---- */\n  .csd{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;}\n  .tier{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;min-height:0;}\n  .tier--corp{flex:1.2;border:1px solid var(--navy-800);}\n  .tier--unit{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);background:#fff;}\n  .i1{margin-left:16px;}\n  .i2{margin-left:32px;}\n  .i3{margin-left:48px;}\n  .tierh{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:5px 10px;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2C5184,#1F497D);color:#fff;}\n  .tierh--mid{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5A86BE,#4F81BD);}\n  .tierh--lo{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8AA6C8,#7C9AC0);}\n  .tiern{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);\n    border-radius:3px;padding:2px 7px;}\n  .tiert{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;}\n  .tierb{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:10px;padding:5px 9px;min-height:0;}\n  .tierb--corp{flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#F4F7FB;}\n\n  .org{flex:0 0 150px;display:flex;align-items:center;min-width:0;\n    border-right:1px dashed var(--neutral-300);padding-right:8px;}\n  .org svg{width:100%;height:100%;}\n\n  .vis{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;}\n  .visk{flex:0 0 34px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:var(--navy-800);\n    border-radius:3px;text-align:center;padding:3px 0;}\n  .visv{flex:1;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-navy);line-height:1.25;}\n  .goals{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:5px;}\n  .goal{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--blue-300);border-radius:3px;padding:5px 3px;\n    text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy-800);line-height:1.2;}\n\n  .kpi{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-evenly;gap:3px;min-width:0;}\n  .kpii{font-size:14px;line-height:1.15;color:var(--ink-700);background:#fff;\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:3px;padding:3px 7px;}\n  .kpii b{color:var(--navy-800);}\n\n  /* 곡선 연결 — SVG 는 곡선·타원·화살표만, 질문 글자는 CSS */\n  .link{position:relative;flex:0 0 28px;height:28px;}\n  .link svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;}\n  .link__t{position:absolute;right:0;top:2px;max-width:392px;}\n  .link__q{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy-800);background:#fff;\n    border:1px dashed var(--blue-400);border-radius:3px;padding:2px 9px;line-height:1.25;}",
    "origin": "40b_SDT_Driver_SVG.html"
  },
